{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人意外地爱上了身边亲近的人，既渴望坦白、被需要，又害怕自己的喜欢给对方压力，最终失去这份亲密。经历试探、短暂安心和反复不安后，他决定不再隐藏感情，珍惜眼前的陪伴，也不再逼对方许诺永远。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"突然心动又怕打扰\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近安心又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"想表白却说不出口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕为难对方\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"心意被看见后更不安\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"确认没被推开才放松\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"觉得自己也被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"敢回应亲近却怕无常\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕有天不再被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"暂且享受此刻亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再为喜欢感到羞耻\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不求回报地尽情付出\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"幸福越真越怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"珍惜当下不强求永远\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06—S09，安心、孤单、觉得自己被需要和害怕失去几种情绪反复切换，有些心理变化需要猜。最抓人的是 S05 和 S10—S14，从害怕暴露喜欢，到愿意坦白，再到明知没有永远仍愿意陪伴，情绪变化很明显。尤其最后回到开头不敢表达的自己，形成了完整的呼应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0716529-d8d2-410b-8111-cc64c7b3a426", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193210849003Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:32:43.747630+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2fbcfb8224113ca82e47ea98469d05a4353fba3a75721883f3d3b3e7165464aa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193210849003Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a921145c2ea8a9d1904719786196aaf3e747be3a3da634ca6bcdda3b8f0bec65"}}}
